        "sample": "independent",
        "date": "2026-09-16",
        "minimum_pair_similarity": 0.881038,
        "reached_group_review_together": false,
        "judgment": "supported exclusion",
        "evidence": "The three studies estimated urban water consumption in Bogotá, returns to irrigation energy choices in Ethiopia, and an alien-plant risk classification in Shenzhen. The third study validated categories against 50 species. They offer no common conservation outcome.",
        "sources": [
          "https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pwat.0000512",
